    "title": "Stevens Elementary teacher posts bail in rape case - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago Mahayla Benavides, 33, has been released from jail after posting bail, following her arrest on charges of raping one of her students. A former Stevens Elementary School teacher has bonded out of jail three weeks after her arrest on charges of rape and molestation of an elementary school student. Mahayla Benavides, 33, pleaded not guilty to the charges prior to release. She was ordered to have no contact with minors until her trial. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
